From 088084b372a92bd8b321462b03f6a3a25ef4c2c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: radhikad <radhikad@ami.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add nsmd required dbus interfaces for VRB-2608-09.03

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [AMI/NVIDIA-specific dbus interface]

nsmd requires the following NVIDIA/xyz.openbmc_project D-Bus interfaces
and enum/property additions that do not yet exist upstream:

 - com.nvidia.AdaptiveTGPMode (NsmAdaptiveTGPMode / nsmProcessor)
 - com.nvidia.ImageCopyState (RoT image copy status/progress)
 - com.nvidia.NVLink.PortHealthMetrics (early health indication)
 - xyz.openbmc_project.Metrics.PortOpticalModuleMetrics
 - xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.LocationReference
   (nsmPort port reference area)
 - com.nvidia.MemoryRowRemapping: convert RowRemappingFailureState and
   RowRemappingPendingState from boolean to enum types
   (RowRemappingFailureStates / RowRemappingPendingStates), matching
   nsmMemory.cpp's usage.
 - com.nvidia.DeviceMode.LTXMode, PowerCappingMode, UPhyRecoveryMode
   (NsmSwitch link-training-extended, power-capping, UPHY recovery
   mode current/pending state)
 - com.nvidia.Software.ProtectionOptionsMode (host firmware/config
   access restriction properties + SetProtectionOptions method, used
   by NsmNetworkAdapterProtectionOptionsMode)
 - xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Location: add missing
   "Connector" value to the LocationTypes enum (used by nsmPort)

Signed-off-by: radhikad <radhikad@ami.com>

Rebased onto main after patch 0013; overlapping existing definitions are
retained and missing generators are registered in the current Meson tree.

---
diff --git a/gen/com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode/meson.build b/gen/com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode/meson.build
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gen/com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode/meson.build
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# Generated file; do not modify.
+
+sdbusplus_current_path = 'com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode'
+
+generated_sources += custom_target(
+    'com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode__cpp'.underscorify(),
+    input: [
+        '../../../../yaml/com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode.interface.yaml',
+    ],
+    output: [
+        'common.hpp',
+        'server.hpp',
+        'server.cpp',
+        'aserver.hpp',
+        'client.hpp',
+    ],
+    depend_files: sdbusplusplus_depfiles,
+    command: [
+        sdbuspp_gen_meson_prog,
+        '--command',
+        'cpp',
+        '--output',
+        meson.current_build_dir(),
+        '--tool',
+        sdbusplusplus_prog,
+        '--directory',
+        meson.current_source_dir() / '../../../../yaml',
+        'com/nvidia/AdaptiveTGPMode',
+    ],
+    install: should_generate_cpp,
+    install_dir: [
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+        false,
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+        get_option('includedir') / sdbusplus_current_path,
+    ],
+    build_by_default: should_generate_cpp,
+)
